                <pb facs="0868" n="782" xml:id="pg782"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                            1903</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman states that the consul at Beirut reports that, owing to the
                    vigorous action of the new governor-general, confidence is being gradually
                    restored; that the chief of police and also the police officer who made the
                    false report on the attempted assassination have been dismissed.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
